{"diagram":{"image":{"x":0,"width":200,"y":0,"pngdata":"","height":200},"elements":{"leftChildren":[],"comments":[],"children":[{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"964dc29e710ef47d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7ba418aa2ab8d3f7","title":"什么是函数。函数就是将一些逻辑写在一起，后续需要使用使用这些逻辑直接使用。不用重复写"},{"parent":"964dc29e710ef47d","children":[{"parent":"88d7edde7e35b84d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"104e3badb2464699","title":"函数可以应对功能的修改。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"88d7edde7e35b84d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"414124abf446c967","title":"Case1:&nbsp;如果计算三角形的面积公式，我们将这些代码每次都拷着跑。&nbsp;<br>有1000处一模一样的逻辑。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"88d7edde7e35b84d","children":[{"parent":"6c257235644c4776","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"0dd60da211f86411","title":"假设有人写代码，完全不复用函数。&nbsp;直接代码逻辑复制到处跑<br>假设系统里面有50处这种判断逻辑"},{"parent":"6c257235644c4776","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7ac476398fbab06d","title":"学校的某一个底层系统。&nbsp;对于学生分等级。&nbsp;比如分数有几个等级&nbsp;<br>[0,60) ==&gt;&nbsp;进步空间巨大<br>[60,70) ===&gt;&nbsp;比较优秀<br>[70, 80)===&gt;&nbsp;很棒<br>[80,100] ===&gt;&nbsp;非常棒"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6c257235644c4776","title":"学校的某一个底层系统。&nbsp;对于学生分等级。&nbsp;比如分数有几个等级&nbsp;<br>[0,60) ==&gt;&nbsp;差<br>[60,80) ===&gt;&nbsp;一般<br>[80, 90)===&gt;&nbsp;良<br>[90,100] ===&gt;&nbsp;优秀"},{"parent":"88d7edde7e35b84d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f792031d719b2426","title":"double calculate_triangle_area(){"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"88d7edde7e35b84d","title":"比如，一个游戏公司，可能会有大量的三角形面积的计算。比如传三个边，算面积出来；&nbsp;这时候，反复写相同一段代码，不太好。<br>采用的是，直接复用一段逻辑，这个就是函数"},{"parent":"964dc29e710ef47d","children":[{"parent":"5b3a5b9989453276","children":[],"id":"7aebcd6cf3ecebe1","title":"建议写代码的时候，思考一下，能不能提函数，让功能复用一下。"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"5b3a5b9989453276","title":"面试题一般是这样的：&nbsp;简单说说函数的好处<br>为什么要使用函数<br>函数的必要性"},{"parent":"964dc29e710ef47d","children":[{"parent":"fe89348fd64d7b4c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4f4e9df25a22d250","title":"官方写好的，我们直接用的叫库函数"},{"parent":"fe89348fd64d7b4c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"29cbec306f9c0cf9","title":"我们自己写的叫做&nbsp;用户自定义函数<br>"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"fe89348fd64d7b4c","title":"函数分类"},{"parent":"964dc29e710ef47d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7d0880184ab11783","title":"为什么使用函数这个也非常重要"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"964dc29e710ef47d","title":"函数概述"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"827c82565ee8617d","children":[{"parent":"3f310d75a1be2923","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"cda193a1720d9bfa","title":"返回值&nbsp;函数名(形参){<br>函数体<br>}"},{"parent":"3f310d75a1be2923","children":[{"parent":"78590db4f0b1fd44","children":[{"parent":"37f480191a62000e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"97aeecb9d5050c87","title":"就是只有最前面部分<br>int test1(int num)"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"37f480191a62000e","title":"函数头"},{"parent":"78590db4f0b1fd44","children":[{"parent":"89aa1f6103151842","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"923bc96e33df0a25","title":"就是函数的全部部分"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"89aa1f6103151842","title":"函数定义"},{"parent":"78590db4f0b1fd44","children":[{"parent":"a16125c4e1847542","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ad3556b5978eb972","title":"只有大括号里面的内容"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a16125c4e1847542","title":"函数体"},{"parent":"78590db4f0b1fd44","children":[{"parent":"7cb97aba2ea061be","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"1fbfcf7e35d1221e","title":"函数头加分号"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"7cb97aba2ea061be","title":"函数声明"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"78590db4f0b1fd44","title":"有一些特殊的概念，<br>在C中有特殊含义"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"3f310d75a1be2923","title":"定义一个函数的语法"},{"parent":"827c82565ee8617d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"0eb4bea2059937d1","title":"函数调用方式"},{"parent":"827c82565ee8617d","children":[{"parent":"c98f835707fed850","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"2ec532e1efa16962","title":"或者说，在前面先写上函数声明"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"c98f835707fed850","title":"函数的定义顺序影响调用。也就是说，要被调用的函数要写在上面"},{"parent":"827c82565ee8617d","children":[{"parent":"3798fc558e4dfb0a","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"26f0dbc78b680ad8","title":"遵循单一原则。这样可以让函数能复用"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"3798fc558e4dfb0a","title":"函数的设计原则"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"827c82565ee8617d","title":"函数的使用"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"757532e88fed0a17","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"bf645eddcf15d708","title":"exit"},{"parent":"757532e88fed0a17","children":[{"parent":"e737789f30ca1a2b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"52bbc5b5eadb5b32","title":"0用来表示程序正常退出<br>其他的都是不正常"},{"parent":"e737789f30ca1a2b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"85372dd22496d055","title":"EXIT_SUCCESS <br>EXIT_FAILURE<br>"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"e737789f30ca1a2b","title":"顺便讲了退出码"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"757532e88fed0a17","title":"一个特殊的退出函数"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"a7bec8ad040206e6","children":[{"parent":"c2d02d05c0361c8e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f8fe9a7a56149827","title":"局部变量是存储在栈帧中的"},{"parent":"c2d02d05c0361c8e","children":[{"parent":"2c29910c6f0e0e6d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"fbdb5a3d7c316280","title":"一定要知道栈是什么东西：&nbsp;操作受限的线性表，只能在一端进出，数据表现为后进先出。"},{"parent":"2c29910c6f0e0e6d","children":[],"id":"af4adec61f0758d7","title":"1.函数的调用是有代价的，代价是会创建一个栈帧。"},{"parent":"2c29910c6f0e0e6d","children":[],"id":"a90afc69a2a78d80","title":"2.每当要调用一个函数的时候，都要创建一个栈帧，并且将这个栈帧压栈。<br>只有栈顶的栈帧的局部变量才会生效。&nbsp;&nbsp;"},{"parent":"2c29910c6f0e0e6d","children":[],"id":"ed1ca131bf7d78b2","title":"3.当一个函数执行结束，这时候栈顶的栈帧弹栈。&nbsp;这些局部变量就自然失效了。"},{"parent":"2c29910c6f0e0e6d","children":[{"parent":"02e81670d08ee78e","children":[],"id":"720d9184524f0880","title":"1.弹栈的时候，是否需要完成清空这块内存。&nbsp;<br>在真实的实践中，我们完全可以用一个int来标识栈顶的位置，出栈的时候，只需要改这个int。&nbsp;<br>这个时候，速度就会非常快"},{"parent":"02e81670d08ee78e","children":[],"id":"f9c9a884861f4469","title":"2.栈帧里面只存局部变量吗？<br>栈帧里面还会存储，返回的地址（也就是下一行执行哪个代码）<br>返回值也会存储在这里"},{"parent":"02e81670d08ee78e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"19px"},"id":"8ca01c4c71fc4844","title":"如果了解的话，对你理解程序更有帮助。&nbsp;"}],"id":"02e81670d08ee78e","title":"细节"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"2c29910c6f0e0e6d","title":"要调用一个函数，就要创建栈帧，并且将栈帧压入栈中"},{"parent":"c2d02d05c0361c8e","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"e94e0be4a2192a94","title":"一定要理解函数的调用过程。重点"},{"parent":"c2d02d05c0361c8e","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"0cf6e215f4f512ef","title":"只要理解了函数的调用过程，局部变量的特点就知道。&nbsp;随着栈同生共死"},{"parent":"c2d02d05c0361c8e","children":[{"parent":"97fc4461ea48bc7d","children":[{"parent":"8e4a15564aa9135e","children":[],"id":"18acf4183e3d6a87","title":"简单高效。"},{"parent":"8e4a15564aa9135e","children":[],"id":"dd81c0419491b321","title":"自动管理内存"}],"id":"8e4a15564aa9135e","title":"优点"},{"parent":"97fc4461ea48bc7d","children":[{"parent":"c3561a1de4f335a5","children":[],"id":"b7b4543a7f02fc36","title":"内存小。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"c3561a1de4f335a5","children":[],"id":"4627b96c25da0286","title":"为了保证简单高效，栈帧大小需要在编译时确定。&nbsp;<br>所以不具有动态性。"}],"id":"c3561a1de4f335a5","title":"缺点"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold"},"id":"97fc4461ea48bc7d","title":"栈区数据的优点缺点"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"c2d02d05c0361c8e","title":"局部变量"},{"parent":"a7bec8ad040206e6","children":[{"parent":"a0485e5f89c41411","children":[],"id":"acd58f062c32f0ab","title":"存储在数据段上。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"a0485e5f89c41411","children":[],"id":"6dfbf55f10a1c188","title":"生命周期就是跟着程序同生共死。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"a0485e5f89c41411","children":[{"parent":"3f455b191cab6a69","children":[],"id":"62def124f5c5161e","title":"名字要注意一下。 global_***"},{"parent":"3f455b191cab6a69","children":[],"id":"fefbee30e4727cfe","title":"如果实在要用，先考虑用静态全局变量。<br>在全局变量前面加static。&nbsp;"}],"id":"3f455b191cab6a69","title":"尽量不要用。&nbsp;"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a0485e5f89c41411","title":"全局变量"},{"parent":"a7bec8ad040206e6","children":[{"parent":"154cdc944c0e0f4f","children":[],"id":"ddeca6227a134f69","title":"加了static的全局变量"},{"parent":"154cdc944c0e0f4f","children":[],"id":"b6c58024c8a3e0f6","title":"在当前文件中能访问。其他文件中访问不了"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"154cdc944c0e0f4f","title":"静态全局变量"},{"parent":"a7bec8ad040206e6","children":[{"parent":"00ed026ccc0db69e","children":[],"id":"a92e3af68b601116","title":"局部变量 + static"},{"parent":"00ed026ccc0db69e","children":[],"id":"60d72fe7bacf86d1","title":"存储的位置发生了变化。存储在数据段上<br>生命周期：&nbsp;程序活着就活着，活的很久"},{"parent":"00ed026ccc0db69e","children":[{"parent":"d8d17ebae51bb296","children":[],"id":"2fb1fd19e8cba645","title":"如果没有手动初始化，为0值；<br>如果手动初始化了，只会初始化1次"}],"id":"d8d17ebae51bb296","title":"初始化"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"00ed026ccc0db69e","title":"静态局部变量"},{"parent":"a7bec8ad040206e6","children":[{"parent":"78b0dacf853a501f","children":[],"id":"64d8f425077cd3d8","title":"1.建议优先选局部变量。&nbsp;在工作过程中，90%都是用它，<br>没有其他特殊的场景，不要想着用其他的。&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>"},{"parent":"78b0dacf853a501f","children":[],"id":"5ed736f1d3c430d9","title":"2.如果要在多个函数之间共享数据，先考虑一下传参能不能解决。<br>&nbsp;如果解决不了，这时候先考虑静态全局变量。（因为可以限制在一个文件内部使用，其他地方不能用）"},{"parent":"78b0dacf853a501f","children":[],"id":"6b5ec9d73333b561","title":"3.最后再考虑全局变量。&nbsp;"}],"id":"78b0dacf853a501f","title":"关于如何选择这些变量"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a7bec8ad040206e6","title":"变量的分类"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"dc536a52ec21f66c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"28fd592b5532b9bc","title":"C在函数调用过程中，传参的行为问题。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"dc536a52ec21f66c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"21bbf7b186ec995e","title":"都是值传递，简单说，就是会将参数的值复制一份，传入函数内部。"},{"parent":"dc536a52ec21f66c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"df0edc58938fe2e7","title":"所以我们在函数内部改参数，不会影响外部的"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"dc536a52ec21f66c","title":"值传递"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"1a5cc7ca89aac4c9","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"0f013b15131df62d","title":"就是函数自己调用自己的一个特殊用法。&nbsp;但是递归在解决一些问题的分解时比较容易"},{"parent":"1a5cc7ca89aac4c9","children":[{"parent":"84d123cd88aa97ac","children":[],"id":"ae937950242b855b","title":"优点：&nbsp;代码简洁、容易理解"},{"parent":"84d123cd88aa97ac","children":[],"id":"bd258429cd86b8c4","title":"缺点：&nbsp;占用栈空间，非常容易栈溢出<br>可能会存在大量的重复计算"},{"parent":"84d123cd88aa97ac","children":[],"id":"a7c5bfae85fd865a","title":"如果能不用递归就尽量不要用递归。&nbsp;<br>有时候写不出来，就先用递归写。&nbsp;"}],"id":"84d123cd88aa97ac","title":"要知道递归的优点和缺点"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"1a5cc7ca89aac4c9","title":"递归"}],"root":true,"theme":"{\"background\":\"#ffffff\",\"title\":\"基础曲线\",\"startType\":[],\"marginH\":24,\"marginW\":50,\"childMarginH\":24,\"childMarginW\":16,\"common\":{\"family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"italic\":false,\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"connectionStyle\":{\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#8A8A8A\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"centerTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#00A59A\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"font-size\":\"20px\",\"border-radius\":\"12px\",\"padding\":\"13px 20px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"secTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#EEEEEE\",\"border-radius\":\"10px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"font-size\":\"18px\",\"padding\":\"8px 14px\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"curve\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"childTopic\":{\"font-size\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"padding\":\"3px 12px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"roundBroken\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\",\"border-radius\":\"30px\"},\"id\":\"customise_efe174d4bfb5\"}","showWatermark":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"root","title":"03_函数","version":337,"structure":"mind"}},"meta":{"exportTime":"2025-05-14 21:32:32","member":"","diagramInfo":{"creator":"","created":"","modified":"","title":"","category":""},"id":"","type":"ProcessOn Schema File","version":"1.0"}}